# {{project_name}}

A bare SPRAG application. No routes yet — start by adding one.

## Quick Start

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
. .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
sprag add index
sprag dev --port 8000
```

Open <http://127.0.0.1:8000/>.

## Project Layout

```
{{project_name}}/
├── app/
│   ├── __init__.py        # App() — registers routes
│   └── routes/            # empty — add routes with `sprag add`
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md
```

Scaffold routes with `sprag add <name>` (see `sprag add --help` for
mode and other flags).
